		<Meldungstext>\T\L\S\K\ABit sequence 7 6 5 4 3 2 1 0

Every digit = 0 (button not pressed) or 1 (button pressed)\L\S\K\N
 \L\S\K\A
 0\L\S\K\N = RADIO (in USA version: FM/AM)\L\S\K\A
 1\L\S\K\N = CD/TV (in USA version: CD/SD)\L\S\K\A
 2\L\S\K\N = NAME\L\S\K\A
 3\L\S\K\N = TEL\L\S\K\A
 4\L\S\K\N = NAV \L\S\K\A
 5\L\S\K\N = INFO\L\S\K\A
 6\L\S\K\N = CAR \L\S\K\A
 7\L\S\K\N = SETUP\L\S\K\I


 Example:\L\S\K\N \L\S\K\I
 0 0 1 0 1 1 0 1  = RADIO, NAME, TEL, INFO buttons pressed</Meldungstext>
